<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>FINANSMART — Login</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@700;800&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"></head>
<body class="auth-page"><div class="auth-wrap">
<div class="auth-brand">
  <div class="logo-wrap" style="margin-bottom:2.5rem">
    <img src="/img/logo.png" width="44" height="44" alt="FINANSMART" style="border-radius:12px;flex-shrink:0">
    FINAN<span class="green">SMART</span>
  </div>
  <h1>Controla tus <span class="green">gastos</span>,<br>alcanza tus <span style="color:#FFD166">metas</span>.</h1>
  <p>La plataforma financiera para jóvenes mexicanos.</p>
  <ul class="feat-list"><li>Registro de ingresos y egresos</li><li>Dashboard con gráficas en tiempo real</li><li>Alertas inteligentes de presupuesto</li><li>Metas de ahorro con seguimiento</li></ul>
</div>
<div class="auth-card">
  <div class="ch">
    <div class="logo-wrap">
      <img src="/img/logo.png" width="32" height="32" alt="FINANSMART" style="border-radius:9px;flex-shrink:0">
      FINANSMART
    </div>
    <span class="link-r">¿No tienes cuenta? <strong onclick="location='/registro'">Regístrate →</strong></span>
  </div>
  <h2>Bienvenido de nuevo</h2>
  <p class="auth-sub">Ingresa tus credenciales para continuar</p>
  <% if(error){%><div class="a-err">⚠ <%=error%></div><%}%>
  <form method="POST" action="/login">
    <div class="fg"><label>CORREO ELECTRÓNICO</label><input type="email" name="correo" placeholder="usuario@ejemplo.com" required></div>
    <div class="fg"><label>CONTRASEÑA</label><input type="password" name="contrasena" placeholder="••••••••" required></div>
    <div class="frow"><label class="chk"><input type="checkbox"> Recuérdame</label><a href="/recuperar" class="lg">¿Olvidaste tu contraseña?</a></div>
    <button type="submit" class="btn-p full">INICIAR SESIÓN</button>
  </form>
  <div class="divider"><span>ó</span></div>
  <a href="/auth/google" class="btn-google" style="text-decoration:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.7rem">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="20" height="20"><path fill="#EA4335" d="M24 9.5c3.5 0 6.6 1.2 9.1 3.2l6.8-6.8C35.8 2.4 30.3 0 24 0 14.7 0 6.7 5.4 2.8 13.3l7.9 6.1C12.5 13.2 17.8 9.5 24 9.5z"/><path fill="#4285F4" d="M46.9 24.5c0-1.6-.1-3.1-.4-4.5H24v8.5h12.9c-.6 3-2.3 5.5-4.8 7.2l7.5 5.8c4.4-4.1 6.9-10.1 6.9-17z"/><path fill="#FBBC05" d="M10.7 28.6A14.5 14.5 0 0 1 9.5 24c0-1.6.3-3.1.8-4.6l-7.9-6.1A23.9 23.9 0 0 0 0 24c0 3.9.9 7.5 2.5 10.8l8.2-6.2z"/><path fill="#34A853" d="M24 48c6.5 0 11.9-2.1 15.9-5.8l-7.5-5.8c-2.2 1.5-5 2.4-8.4 2.4-6.2 0-11.5-3.7-13.3-9l-8.2 6.2C6.7 42.6 14.7 48 24 48z"/></svg>
    Continuar con Google
  </a>
  <div class="trust"><span>🔒 SSL</span><span>🛡 Datos protegidos</span><span>✓ ISO 27001</span></div>
</div></div>
<script>function togglePass(id){const i=document.getElementById(id);i.type=i.type==='password'?'text':'password'}</script>
</body></html>
